  "description": "The Aspire Gotek Nano Pod Kit is an ultra-compact, lightweight, and stylish device perfect for vapers seeking portability without compromising on performance. Powered by a 1000mAh built-in battery, the Gotek Nano provides reliable all-day vaping with easy recharging via USB-C fast charging. Its draw-activated mechanism ensures effortless operation, making it an ideal choice for both new and experienced vapers. The Gotek Nano is compatible with Aspire's Gotek Series Pods, featuring a 2ml e-liquid capacity and advanced mesh coil technology that delivers consistently rich flavour with every puff. The adjustable bottom airflow lets users customise their vape for a more tailored mouth-to-lung (MTL) experience. With eight stunning colour options, including Cosmic Blue, Rose Gold, Aqua Blue, and Sakura Pink, the Aspire Gotek Nano adds a touch of flair to its ergonomic design. Built with Aspire’s ASP chip for comprehensive safety protection, the Gotek Nano combines style, performance, and reliability in one pocket-friendly device. Discover our UK e-liquid range and enjoy flavours that match your kit effortlessly. Please note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
